SUMMARY:Meet New People\, Great Conversations & 50+ Board Games | 25–45 
 | Fast Friends 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nEver wish there w
 ere an easier way to turn a room full of strangers into people you actuall
 y want to talk to?\n*That’s what Fast Friends is designed for.*\n\nInste
 ad of arriving at a busy pub and wondering who to approach\, our host guid
 es you through short conversations and rotations\, giving you the chance t
 o meet a variety of people throughout the evening. You get a little struct
 ure to make connecting easier — without making the evening feel forced o
 r formal.\n\nAnd once the hosted rounds finish\, you can keep the evening 
 going. 🎲\nWe’re back at Stout Irish Pub in Cabbagetown — a relaxed 
 Irish pub with food\, drinks and 50+ board games\, giving you plenty of wa
 ys to continue socialising with the people you’ve met.\n\n🎟️ Book E
 arly & Save: [https://toronto14thnov.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto14th
 nov.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door:
  CAD $20 cash — to host Kristabelle\nBooking ahead helps us plan the rig
 ht group size and venue space\, and your ticket confirms your place.\n\n
 🤝 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Faye\,
  grab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? Completely fine. Many guests a
 rrive solo\, and we’ll help you get comfortable and connected from the s
 tart.\n7:30 PM — Fast Friends\nThis is where the evening gets going.\nYo
 u’ll move through a series of short\, guided conversations\, meeting dif
 ferent people along the way. Our host keeps the rotations moving\, so you 
 don’t have to worry about who to approach or what to do next.\nJust show
  up\, join the conversation and see who you click with.\n\n✨ Themed Conn
 ection Rounds\nThroughout the evening\, we’ll mix in themed rounds and i
 nteractive prompts designed to make connecting easier.\nThey’ll help you
  discover shared interests\, experiences and unexpected things you have in
  common — taking the conversation beyond the usual small talk.\n\n🎲 8
 :30 PM onwards — Board Games & Socialising\nOnce the hosted rounds finis
 h\, the evening doesn’t have to.\nStout has 50+ board games available\, 
 making it easy to keep the conversations going. Pick a game with the peopl
 e you’ve met\, grab another drink\, join a group or simply continue chat
 ting.\nYou don’t have to be a serious gamer — the games are simply ano
 ther easy way to socialise and get to know people.\n\n🍻 Staying Later?\
 nStout’s current After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM\, with $7 beers 
 and $7 highballs\, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\n✔️
  Meet 15–25 new people in one evening\n✔️ Guided conversations make 
 meeting people easier\n✔️ Meet different people through rotating conve
 rsations\n✔️ Interactive themed rounds to spark better conversations\n
 ✔️ 50+ board games available afterwards 🎲\n✔️ Relaxed Irish pub
  atmosphere\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n✔️ Most guests come 
 solo\n✔️ Plenty of time to keep socialising after the hosted rounds\n
 ✔️ Friendship-focused — not a dating event\n\n👋 Who Is It For?\nA
 ges 25–45\nWhether you’ve just moved to Toronto\, have lived here for 
 years\, or simply feel like your social circle could use some fresh faces\
 , you’re welcome.\nYou don’t need to know anyone beforehand or arrive 
 with a group.\nCome by yourself\, bring a friend\, or simply come ready to
  have a few good conversations and see where the evening takes you.\n\n
 🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringin
 g people together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ citie
 s worldwide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\, more re
 laxed and more enjoyable.\nCome for the conversations. Stay for the games.
  Leave with new connections. ❤️
