DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nAs the year draws
  to a close\, why not make room for some new faces and friendships? ❤️
 \nJoin Fast Friends at Stout Irish Pub for a professionally hosted social 
 evening where guided conversations\, rotations and themed connection round
 s make meeting new people easier and more enjoyable — even if you're com
 ing on your own.\nAnd there's more to the evening! Stay for 50+ board game
 s\, drinks\, food and Stout's After Dark Specials. 🎲🍻\n\n🎟️ Boo
 k Early & Save: [https://toronto28thnov.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto2
 8thnov.eventbrite.co.uk)\nYou can pay securely online with any debit or cr
 edit card through PayPal — no PayPal account required.\nAdvance tickets 
 are cheaper and help us plan the right space and group size for a comforta
 ble evening.\nEarly Bird: CAD $10 \\| Regular: CAD $15 \\| At the Door: CA
 D $20 cash\n\n🤝 The Evening\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Settle In\nMeet your
  host\, Kruttika\, grab a drink and get comfortable.\nWhether you've recen
 tly moved to Toronto or have lived here for years\, it's a chance to step 
 out\, meet some new faces and enjoy a different kind of Saturday evening.\
 nComing alone? You're very welcome — many guests attend solo\, and our h
 ost will help you settle in and get connected.\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted 
 Fast Friends\nMeeting people doesn't have to mean approaching a room full 
 of strangers and hoping a conversation takes off.\nOur host guides you thr
 ough short conversations and rotations\, so you can meet a variety of peop
 le throughout the evening. You don't have to worry about who to approach o
 r what to say next — the structure makes it easier to get involved and d
 iscover who you connect with.\n\n✨ Themed Connection Rounds\nWe'll add i
 nteractive prompts and themed conversation challenges to help you discover
  shared interests\, swap stories and find unexpected common ground.\nFrom 
 travel and food to music\, hobbies and weekend adventures\, these rounds h
 elp move conversations beyond the usual small talk.\n🎲 8:30 PM onwards 
 — 50+ Board Games & Socialising\n\nWhy end the evening just as you're ge
 tting to know people?\nStout has more than 50 board games available\, givi
 ng you an easy way to keep socialising after the hosted rounds. Join a gam
 e\, meet others around the table\, share a few laughs\, grab another drink
  or simply continue a conversation.\nYou don't need to be a board-game exp
 ert. It's all about having fun together and giving new connections more ti
 me to grow.\n\n🍻 Stay for Stout's After Dark Specials\nIf you're planni
 ng to stay later\, Stout's After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM\, with $
 7 beers and $7 highballs\, among other specials.\nIt's a great way to exte
 nd your evening\, relax with the people you've met and enjoy more of Stout
 's lively pub atmosphere.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\n✔️ Meet 20+ new p
 eople in one evening\n✔️ Professionally hosted conversations and rotat
 ions\n✔️ Interactive themed rounds to spark better conversations\n✔
 ️ 50+ board games at Stout 🎲\n✔️ Stout's After Dark Specials from
  9–11 PM 🍻\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n✔️ Relaxed Irish
  pub atmosphere\n✔️ An opportunity to meet members from across our Tor
 onto Meetup communities\n✔️ Solo attendees welcome\n✔️ Designed fo
 r ladies and gents aged 25–45\n✔️ Friendship-focused — not a datin
 g event\n\n📍 Why Stout Irish Pub?\nLocated at 221 Carlton Street\, Stou
 t offers a relaxed\, welcoming pub atmosphere with food\, drinks and an im
 pressive selection of more than 50 board games.\nIt's a great setting for 
 an evening that starts with hosted conversations and continues with board 
 games\, laughter and more time to get to know the people you've met.\n\n
 👥 Who Is It For?\nYou don't need to be new to Toronto\, belong to an ex
 isting group or know anyone attending.\nWhether you're looking to build a 
 social circle\, meet people beyond work\, make friends after moving to the
  city or simply enjoy a different kind of Saturday night\, you're welcome.
 \nCome by yourself or bring a friend. We'll help make the introductions ea
 sier.\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has bee
 n bringing people together through professionally hosted social events in 
 30+ cities worldwide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\
 , more relaxed and more enjoyable.\nCome for the conversations. Stay for t
 he board games. Leave with new connections. ❤️\nCome solo. We'll guide
  the experience. You make the connections. 🤝
